abstract: "Data tables and Python code for a terrain-controlled, multi-event analysis of how the association between bamboo forests and rainfall-triggered landslides varies with hillslope steepness in Taiwan (2018 to 2025), with a deterministic verification chain that recomputes every reported quantity from the frozen tables and writes it to a register."
